  "description": "Greybox reference puzzle for sound (mw-e15.10): a button on the south bank makes a hidden source in a closet behind the west wall chime three times, high, low, mid, and across a 6 m pit three bells stand against the north wall. Strike them in the order you heard and the portcullis opens; a wrong bell rings a wrong chime and starts the order over. The bells are out of reach, so something has to be thrown, shot or cast at them: a crate lobbed over the pit, a crate carried over with Mage Hand. The order can also be known without listening (a keeper's ledger; there is no readable item for it yet, see the puzzle notes). Reach it with ?scene=chimes.",
